<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/13/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister under subsection 1(2) of the Penal Code (Amendment) Act 2006 [Act A1273]. Substitution of section 7"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/13/eng@> .
