<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/13/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Penal Code (Amendment) Act 2006, which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended by substituting for section 7 the following section: \"Amendment of section 376 7. The Code is amended by substituting for section 376 the following section: \"Punishment for rape 376. (1) Subject to subsections (2), (3) and (4), whoever commits rape shall be punished with imprisonment for a term which may extend to twenty years, and shall also be liable to whipping."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/13/eng@> .
