<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/13/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Whoever commits rape on a woman whose relationship to him is such that he is not permitted under the law, religion, custom or usage, to marry her, shall be punished with imprisonment for a term of not less than eight years and not more than thirty years, and shall also be punished with whipping of not less than ten strokes."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/13/eng@> .
